DTSTART:20260604T183000
DTEND:20260604T200000
SUMMARY:First Touch & Receiving
LOCATION:Park School
DESCRIPTION:Skills:\nReceiving to feet and turning to face goal\nDirectiona
 l first touch to set up a pass or dribble\nReceiving on the back foot and p
 laying away from pressure\nSettling a driven pass with a soft inside-of-foo
 t touch\nChecking off a defender to create space before receiving\nBody sha
 pe and foot orientation before the ball arrives
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tech-2026-06-05@btw2026
DTSTART:20260605T151500
DTEND:20260605T164500
SUMMARY:Passing & Combination Play
LOCATION:Cypress Field
DESCRIPTION:Skills:\nWall pass\nThird-man run\nWeight and accuracy of short
  passes under pressure\nOne-touch passing to maintain speed of play\nPlayin
 g through a press as a unit of three\nSwitching the point of attack with a 
 driven pass
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tech-2026-06-07@btw2026
DTSTART:20260607T163000
DTEND:20260607T180000
SUMMARY:1v1 Attacking vs. Defending
LOCATION:Cypress Field
DESCRIPTION:Skills:\nStep-over\, scissors\, or Cruyff turn to beat a defend
 er\nCommitting the defender before attempting a move\nJockeying\nForcing th
 e attacker onto their weak foot\nWinning the ball back with a clean tackle 
 when the moment is right\nDribbling with purpose
END:VEVENT
